          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">While this model is leading a BLOOD CLAWS unit, each time a model in that unit makes a melee attack, you can re-roll the Wound roll. While this model is leading a WOLF GUARD HEADTAKERS UNIT, that unit is eligible to declare a charge in a turn in which it Advanced.</characteristic>
