            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">You can re-roll Charge rolls made for this unit. Each time this unit makes a Charge move, until the end of the turn, each time a model in this unit makes a melee attack, add 1 to the Hit roll.</characteristic>
